{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-crisis","title":"高二地理 — 资源危机","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/geography/global-issues/resource-crisis","wordCount":2185,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高二地理-资源危机\">高二地理 — 资源危机</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>自然资源是人类社会存续和发展的物质基础。随着全球人口增长和工业化进程加速，水资源、矿产资源、能源资源和土地资源的消耗速度远超自然补给能力，资源危机正从局部问题演变为全球性挑战。资源地理学研究资源的分布规律、开发利用方式及可持续管理策略，是高中地理的重要内容板块。</p>\n<p>主要自然资源分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类标准</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>代表资源</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按可再生性</td>\n<td>可再生资源</td>\n<td>水、森林、渔业、太阳能、风能</td>\n<td>可循环利用，但过度使用会退化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>非可再生资源</td>\n<td>煤、石油、天然气、金属矿</td>\n<td>储量有限，用完不可再生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按属性</td>\n<td>气候资源</td>\n<td>光照、热量、降水</td>\n<td>决定农业类型和生产力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>水资源</td>\n<td>河流、湖泊、地下水</td>\n<td>分布不均，供需矛盾突出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>生物资源</td>\n<td>森林、草地、鱼类</td>\n<td>可再生但需合理利用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>矿产资源</td>\n<td>铁矿、铜矿、稀土</td>\n<td>分布高度集中，战略意义大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-水资源危机\">一、水资源危机</h3><p>地球上水的总量约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13.86</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13.86</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13.86</span></span></span></span></span> 亿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{km}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，但淡水仅占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.53</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.53\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.53%</span></span></span></span></span>，其中可直接利用的河流水、湖泊淡水和浅层地下水不足总量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>全球水资源分布不均</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>南美洲拥有全球约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>26</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">26\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26%</span></span></span></span></span> 的淡水资源，但人口仅占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>亚洲人口占全球 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span>，但淡水仅占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>36</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>非洲撒哈拉以南地区约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 亿人无法获得安全饮用水</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>中国水资源困境</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>总量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.8</span></span></span></span></span> 万亿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（全球第六），但人均仅为世界平均水平的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/4</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>时空分布极不均匀：南方占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>81</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">81\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">81%</span></span></span></span></span>，北方仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>19</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">19\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">19%</span></span></span></span></span>；夏秋多、冬春少</li>\n<li>华北平原地下水严重超采，形成大面积地下水漏斗</li>\n</ul>\n<p>水资源危机的应对策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>具体措施</th>\n<th>典型案例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开源</td>\n<td>海水淡化、雨水收集、污水回用</td>\n<td>以色列海水淡化满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span> 生活用水</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节流</td>\n<td>节水灌溉、阶梯水价、工业水循环</td>\n<td>中国推广滴灌和喷灌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调配</td>\n<td>跨流域调水</td>\n<td>南水北调工程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保护</td>\n<td>水源地保护、污染治理</td>\n<td>太湖流域水环境综合治理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二-能源资源危机\">二、能源资源危机</h3><p>化石能源（煤、石油、天然气）目前仍占全球一次能源消费的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>82</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">82\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">82%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上。按当前开采速度，已探明的石油储量可供使用约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 年，天然气约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 年，煤炭约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>130</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">130</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">130</span></span></span></span></span> 年。</p>\n<p><strong>全球能源分布格局</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能源</th>\n<th>主要储量分布</th>\n<th>主要消费地</th>\n<th>供需矛盾</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>石油</td>\n<td>中东（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48%</span></span></span></span></span>）、南美、俄罗斯</td>\n<td>北美、东亚、欧洲</td>\n<td>消费中心与产地分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>天然气</td>\n<td>俄罗斯、中东、美国</td>\n<td>北美、欧洲、东亚</td>\n<td>依赖管道和LNG运输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>煤炭</td>\n<td>美国、俄罗斯、中国、印度</td>\n<td>中国、印度、美国</td>\n<td>环境代价高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>中国的能源安全</strong>：中国是全球最大的能源生产国和消费国。2023年中国石油对外依存度约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>72</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72%</span></span></span></span></span>，天然气约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>42</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">42\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">42%</span></span></span></span></span>。能源安全面临的核心风险包括：进口通道（马六甲海峡）单一、国际油价波动、地缘政治冲突。</p>\n<p><strong>能源转型</strong>是破解能源危机的根本出路：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>中国风电装机容量全球第一（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 亿千瓦）</li>\n<li>中国光伏发电装机全球第一，光伏组件产量占全球 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上</li>\n<li>核电、氢能、生物质能等新能源快速发展</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"三-矿产资源危机\">三、矿产资源危机</h3><p>矿产资源是工业的&quot;粮食&quot;。全球矿产资源分布高度集中，且部分关键矿产的供应链极为脆弱。</p>\n<p><strong>关键矿产及其战略意义</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>矿产</th>\n<th>全球主要产地</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n<th>供应风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>稀土</td>\n<td>中国（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span>）、缅甸、澳大利亚</td>\n<td>新能源汽车电机、风力发电机、电子产品</td>\n<td>中国供应占主导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锂</td>\n<td>澳大利亚、智利、中国</td>\n<td>锂电池（新能源汽车）</td>\n<td>需求激增，产能跟不上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钴</td>\n<td>刚果（金）（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>锂电池正极材料</td>\n<td>高度集中于政治不稳定地区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铁矿石</td>\n<td>澳大利亚、巴西</td>\n<td>钢铁工业</td>\n<td>中国进口依赖度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>矿产开发的环境代价同样不容忽视：尾矿污染、地面塌陷、水土流失、植被破坏。中国许多矿区面临&quot;开发一方、破坏一方&quot;的困境。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-土地资源危机\">四、土地资源危机</h3><p>全球可耕地面积约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 亿公顷，仅占陆地面积的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>。但城市化扩张、荒漠化、盐碱化和水土流失等因素导致耕地持续减少。</p>\n<p><strong>中国的土地资源压力</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>耕地面积约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.28</span></span></span></span></span> 亿公顷（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>19.18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">19.18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">19.18</span></span></span></span></span> 亿亩），人均仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.09</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.09</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.09</span></span></span></span></span> 公顷，不足世界平均水平的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>耕地红线：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> 亿亩（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span></span></span></span></span> 亿公顷）不可突破</li>\n<li>威胁因素：城市蔓延占用优质农田、南方酸雨导致土壤酸化、北方风蚀沙化</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>荒漠化</strong>是全球最严重的土地退化问题。中国荒漠化土地面积约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>261</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">261</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">261</span></span></span></span></span> 万 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，主要分布在西北干旱半干旱区。三北防护林工程是世界上最大的生态工程，旨在遏制荒漠化扩展。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-资源危机的系统性思考\">五、资源危机的系统性思考</h3><p>资源问题不是孤立存在的，而是相互关联的系统性挑战：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>水-能源关联</strong>（Water-Energy Nexus）：发电需要水（火电冷却、水电蓄水），供水需要能源（抽水、淡化、输配）</li>\n<li><strong>水-粮食关联</strong>：农业灌溉消耗全球淡水用量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>能源-矿产关联</strong>：新能源转型需要大量锂、钴、稀土等矿产</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种关联意味着任何一种资源的短缺都可能引发连锁效应。</p>\n<p><strong>资源诅咒</strong>（Resource Curse）现象也值得关注：一些资源丰富的国家反而经济发展缓慢、政治腐败严重（如尼日利亚、委内瑞拉）。丰富的自然资源并不自动转化为国家竞争力，制度建设和人力资本投资才是关键。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-可持续资源管理\">六、可持续资源管理</h3><p><strong>循环经济</strong>是资源可持续利用的核心模式，遵循&quot;减量化—再利用—再循环&quot;（3R）原则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>内涵</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Reduce（减量化）</td>\n<td>源头减少资源消耗</td>\n<td>轻量化包装、节能建筑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reuse（再利用）</td>\n<td>延长产品使用寿命</td>\n<td>二手交易平台、旧衣回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Recycle（再循环）</td>\n<td>将废弃物转化为新资源</td>\n<td>废钢回炉、塑料瓶再生</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>在世界地图上标注全球水资源丰富和缺乏的主要地区，分析其分布与气候、人口的关系。</li>\n<li>计算题：某市年用水量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 亿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中地下水占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span>。如果该市推行节水措施使总用水量减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>，并将地下水比例降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>，则地下水年开采量减少了多少？</li>\n<li>为什么中国需要保守 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> 亿亩耕地红线？从粮食安全角度分析。</li>\n<li>讨论&quot;资源诅咒&quot;现象：为什么一些资源大国反而经济落后？制度因素起了什么作用？</li>\n<li>设计一个校园节水方案，包括技术手段和管理措施各三条。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>联合国《世界水资源发展报告》每年聚焦一个主题，追踪全球水资源开发利用状况。</li>\n<li>国际能源署（IEA）《世界能源展望》是了解全球能源趋势和转型路径的核心参考。</li>\n<li>中国自然资源部定期发布《中国矿产资源报告》和《中国土地资源公报》，提供详实的国内资源数据。</li>\n<li>&quot;城市矿山&quot;概念将废弃电子产品视为可开发的&quot;矿山&quot;，其中贵金属含量远高于天然矿石。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>资源危机的本质是人类需求增长与自然资源有限供给之间的矛盾。水、能源、矿产和土地这四类核心资源各有其分布规律和供需特征，但彼此深度关联、相互制约。应对资源危机需要从开源（开发替代资源、技术创新）、节流（提高利用效率、循环经济）和制度（资源税费改革、国际合作）三个维度综合施策。中国作为资源消耗大国，在南水北调、新能源发展、耕地红线保护等方面积累了丰富实践经验，但资源安全形势仍然严峻，可持续发展任重道远。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高二地理 — 资源危机","id":"高二地理-资源危机"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、水资源危机","id":"一-水资源危机"},{"level":3,"text":"二、能源资源危机","id":"二-能源资源危机"},{"level":3,"text":"三、矿产资源危机","id":"三-矿产资源危机"},{"level":3,"text":"四、土地资源危机","id":"四-土地资源危机"},{"level":3,"text":"五、资源危机的系统性思考","id":"五-资源危机的系统性思考"},{"level":3,"text":"六、可持续资源管理","id":"六-可持续资源管理"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高二地理 — 气候变化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/geography/global-issues/climate-change"},"next":{"title":"高二地理 — 环境治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/geography/global-issues/environmental-governance"}}